<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - NYS Dormitory Auth., $30 mln.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - NYS Dormitory Auth., $30 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $30,000,000</p>
<p>BARNARD COLLEGE</p>
<p>INSURED REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>William E. Simon &amp; Sons Municipal Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
